== before init
list                                 not_found: this domain has no vault: run tsync vault init
lock                                 ok
== locked
add                                  locked: the vault is locked: run tsync vault unlock
list                                 locked: the vault is locked: run tsync vault unlock
code                                 locked: the vault is locked: run tsync vault unlock
rename                               locked: the vault is locked: run tsync vault unlock
remove                               locked: the vault is locked: run tsync vault unlock
export                               locked: the vault is locked: run tsync vault unlock
unlock                               ok
== add and list
add the §6 URI                      <id1>
add hotp                             invalid: only otpauth://totp/ URIs are kept
add 9 digits                         invalid: digits is 6 to 8
add an unknown algorithm             invalid: unknown algorithm
add an empty secret                  invalid: the secret is missing
add a lower-case padded secret       <id2>
add a bare secret                    ok
add a secret with no labels          invalid: issuer and account are empty
add a secret and a uri               invalid: totp_add takes a uri or a secret, not both
list
  <id1> "ACME Co" "john@example.com" code of 6 digits
  <id2> "Other" "bob" code of 6 digits
  <id3> "Text" "typed" code of 6 digits
list acme
  <id1> "ACME Co" "john@example.com" code of 6 digits
code                                 matches the seed: true, carries no seed: true
code of a malformed id               invalid: "xyz" is not a record id
code of an absent id                 not_found: no record 00000000000000000000000000000000
rename                               ok
rename to nothing                    invalid: issuer and account cannot both be empty
rename a malformed id                invalid: "xyz" is not a record id
remove an absent id                  not_found: no record 00000000000000000000000000000000
list
  <id1> "ACME Inc" "john@example.com" code of 6 digits
  <id2> "Other" "bob" code of 6 digits
  <id3> "Text" "typed" code of 6 digits
export without a passphrase          invalid: passphrase is required
export, a wrong passphrase           denied: wrong passphrase
export
  otpauth://totp/ACME%20Inc:john%40example.com?secret=JBSWY3DPEHPK3PXP&issuer=ACME%20Inc&algorithm=SHA1&digits=6&period=30
  otpauth://totp/Other:bob?secret=GEZDGNBVGY3TQOJQ&issuer=Other&algorithm=SHA1&digits=6&period=30
  otpauth://totp/Text:typed?secret=MFRGGZDFMZTWQ2LK&issuer=Text&algorithm=SHA1&digits=6&period=30
== import
import                               added 1, already 1 {"line":3,"reason":"only otpauth://totp/ URIs are kept"}
the same again                       added 0, already 2 {"line":3,"reason":"only otpauth://totp/ URIs are kept"}
separators                           added 3, already 0 {"line":1,"reason":"entry 3: only otpauth://totp/ URIs are kept"}
list
  <id1> "ACME Inc" "john@example.com" code of 6 digits
  <id4> "B" "b" code of 6 digits
  <id5> "Foo, Inc" "a" code of 6 digits
  <id6> "Mail" "me@example.org" code of 6 digits
  <id2> "Other" "bob" code of 6 digits
  <id7> "Raw, Inc" "r" code of 6 digits
  <id3> "Text" "typed" code of 6 digits
export spare with docs' passphrase   denied: wrong passphrase
an export into an empty domain       added 7, already 0
  the same records                   true
list on a domain without totp        invalid: plain does not use totp: add it to its extensions in the config
== the store
holds the keyring: true
holds a seed: false
holds a label: false
== both rename one record
  pause                              ok
  owner renames                      ok
  resume                             ok
  before the fold: <id1> <id1> (conflicted copy from test) <id2> <id3> <id4> <id5> <id6> <id7>
  list
  <id1> "ACME Inc" "b@example.com" code of 6 digits
  <id4> "B" "b" code of 6 digits
  <id5> "Foo, Inc" "a" code of 6 digits
  <id6> "Mail" "me@example.org" code of 6 digits
  <id2> "Other" "bob" code of 6 digits
  <id7> "Raw, Inc" "r" code of 6 digits
  <id3> "Text" "typed" code of 6 digits
  after: <id1> <id2> <id3> <id4> <id5> <id6> <id7>
== a seed changed in place on B
  pause                              ok
  owner renames                      ok
  resume                             ok
  before the fold: <id1> <id2> <id2> (conflicted copy from test) <id3> <id4> <id5> <id6> <id7>
  list
  <id1> "ACME Inc" "b@example.com" code of 6 digits
  <id4> "B" "b" code of 6 digits
  <id5> "Foo, Inc" "a" code of 6 digits
  <id6> "Mail" "me@example.org" code of 6 digits
  <id2> "Other" "bob" code of 6 digits
  <id8> "Other Inc" "bob" code of 6 digits
  <id7> "Raw, Inc" "r" code of 6 digits
  <id3> "Text" "typed" code of 6 digits
  after: <id1> <id2> <id3> <id4> <id5> <id6> <id7> <id8>
== a record whose plaintext is corrupt
  list
  <id1> "ACME Inc" "b@example.com" code of 6 digits
  <id4> "B" "b" code of 6 digits
  <id5> "Foo, Inc" "a" code of 6 digits
  <id6> "Mail" "me@example.org" code of 6 digits
  <id2> "Other" "bob" code of 6 digits
  <id8> "Other Inc" "bob" code of 6 digits
  <id7> "Raw, Inc" "r" code of 6 digits
  <id3> "Text" "typed" code of 6 digits
  corrupt <id9>
  after: <id1> <id2> <id3> <id4> <id5> <id6> <id7> <id8> <id9>
  export names it: true
  remove it                          ok
  list
  <id1> "ACME Inc" "b@example.com" code of 6 digits
  <id4> "B" "b" code of 6 digits
  <id5> "Foo, Inc" "a" code of 6 digits
  <id6> "Mail" "me@example.org" code of 6 digits
  <id2> "Other" "bob" code of 6 digits
  <id8> "Other Inc" "bob" code of 6 digits
  <id7> "Raw, Inc" "r" code of 6 digits
  <id3> "Text" "typed" code of 6 digits
== both change the keyring
  pause                              ok
  owner changes the passphrase       ok
  resume                             ok
  before the fold: keyring keyring (conflicted copy from test)
  status unlocked slots={"secret-key":2,"unknown":1} copies=[]
  after: keyring
== two inits race; the owner's loses
  the owner adds under its K         <id10>
  status                             locked copies=1
  list                               locked: the vault is locked: run tsync vault unlock
  unlock with the winner's passphrase ok
  list: "Race" "a"
  status                             unlocked copies=0
  the vault folder: keyring
owner exit status 0
